<title>ITALY: Italy Janaury wholesale prices rose 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy Janaury wholesale prices rose 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for January.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Jan 97     Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	 +1.0 pct   +1.4 pct  +9.4 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change     +0.3 pct    0.0 pct  +0.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)    134.8	 134.4     133.5</p>
</text>
